OL,3,ADrag Race co-creator warns of TV
OL,4,Arepresentation 'crisis' after BBC drops
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe move led viewers to raise concerns
OL,8,Fabout the corporation's on-screen
OL,9,Frepresentation, after it also cancelled
OL,10,Ftwo LGBTQ+ dating shows.
OL,12,FA spokesperson for the BBC said the
OL,13,Fdecision was down to "significant
OL,14,Ffinancial pressures", as it attempts to
OL,15,Fmake #500m of savings.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
